# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Online Attendance Management System — environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Database (PostgreSQL) --------------------------------------------------
# Local sandbox Postgres (started with: bun scripts/db-server.ts)
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:postgres@localhost:5433/sms"

# Neon (free tier, recommended for Vercel) — copy the POOLED connection string
# from your Neon dashboard (Project → Dashboard → Connection string → "Pooled").
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://<user>:<password>@ep-<id>-pooler.<region>.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"

# --- Auth -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secret used to sign session JWTs. Generate one with:  openssl rand -base64 32
SESSION_SECRET="change-me-to-a-long-random-string"
